Misho, 14 Oct ~09:30Z, in the code session's chat: „ფასების გვერდიდან
5 დღე წაშალე, ნომრით მოწვევაც დახურე".

Server: the gate admits a new person only on a subscribed member's own
referral code. A subscriber's number typed as „invited by" is refused as
referral_required (58019: anyone who knew a member's number got in
without that member doing anything). The launch cohort's free days come
only with a founder's code. The old-account login (0280) needs a
subscribed member's code too. A typed number still credits its owner
where the door is open for another reason.

docs/FOR_FRONTEND.md: remove every 5-day card-trial line from the pricing
page, and ask for the invitation code only on the login page.

Ships after 0280 (built on it).

